<section class="reviews-mini">
  <div class="wrap-wide">
    <div class="reviews-mini-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Real reviews</span>
      <h2>Loved by people who <em>play.</em></h2>
      <div class="reviews-mini-meta">
        <span class="stars">{% for i in (1..5) %}<svg width="16" height="16"><use href="#i-star"/></svg>{% endfor %}</span>
        <span>Verified buyer reviews</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="reviews-mini-grid">
      <div class="rev-card">
        <div class="stars">{% for i in (1..5) %}<svg><use href="#i-star"/></svg>{% endfor %}</div>
        <span class="sport-tag">🎾 Tennis · 4x / week</span>
        <h5>No 3pm slump</h5>
        <p>One in the morning and I get clean focus through the afternoon without reaching for another coffee. No jitters, no crash.</p>
        <div class="by"><span class="avt">SK</span><span><strong>Sarah K.</strong>Verified buyer · Tennis player</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="rev-card">
        <div class="stars">{% for i in (1..5) %}<svg><use href="#i-star"/></svg>{% endfor %}</div>
        <span class="sport-tag">🏃 Marathon · 60km/wk</span>
        <h5>Finally one I'll drink daily</h5>
        <p>Switched off sugary gels and this is now part of my morning. Light lemon, easy on the stomach, and I like that every dose is printed on the pack.</p>
        <div class="by"><span class="avt">MP</span><span><strong>Mark P.</strong>Verified buyer · Marathon</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="rev-card">
        <div class="stars">{% for i in (1..5) %}<svg><use href="#i-star"/></svg>{% endfor %}</div>
        <span class="sport-tag">🥎 Padel · 3x / week</span>
        <h5>Convenient for hot-weather play</h5>
        <p>Padel in Dubai heat is brutal. One before warm-up, one mid-match. Easy to throw a few sachets in the bag and I'm not lugging a tub of powder around.</p>
        <div class="by"><span class="avt">JD</span><span><strong>James D.</strong>Verified buyer · Padel player</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="rev-card">
        <div class="stars">{% for i in (1..5) %}<svg><use href="#i-star"/></svg>{% endfor %}</div>
        <span class="sport-tag">⚽ Football · 5-a-side</span>
        <h5>One sachet, not four</h5>
        <p>Used to carry an electrolyte tub, a focus supplement, magnesium and a recovery drink. Now it's one sachet pre, one post. Same routine, far less to lug around.</p>
        <div class="by"><span class="avt">ML</span><span><strong>Marco L.</strong>Verified buyer · 5-a-side football</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="rev-card">
        <div class="stars">{% for i in (1..5) %}<svg><use href="#i-star"/></svg>{% endfor %}</div>
        <span class="sport-tag">🚴 Cycling · 200km / wk</span>
        <h5>Keeps me going on long rides</h5>
        <p>Plain water wasn't cutting it on summer rides. IONIQ pre and during big days keeps me steady. Light taste, no sugar, mixes clean in the bottle.</p>
        <div class="by"><span class="avt">AR</span><span><strong>Anna R.</strong>Verified buyer · Cyclist</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="rev-card">
        <div class="stars">{% for i in (1..5) %}<svg><use href="#i-star"/></svg>{% endfor %}</div>
        <span class="sport-tag">🏋️ CrossFit · 5x / week</span>
        <h5>Tastes clean, mixes clear</h5>
        <p>Most electrolyte sachets are either too sweet or taste like chemicals. The lemon is light and clean, dissolves fully, no gritty bottom. Easy to drink every day.</p>
        <div class="by"><span class="avt">TG</span><span><strong>Tom G.</strong>Verified buyer · CrossFit</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% schema %}
{ "name": "Reviews grid", "presets": [{ "name": "Reviews grid" }] }
{% endschema %}